= Planning in artificial intelligence — Simple =

'''Planning''' in AI means figuring out which actions can achieve a goal.

A planner may know:

* where the system starts;
* what actions are possible;
* what each action changes;
* what goal it wants to reach.

It then finds a sequence or policy for acting.

Planning is not the same as carrying out the plan.

In a changing world, an agent may need to check what happened and make a new plan.

